enable
configure terminal

hostname rt2

interface GigabitEthernet0/0/0
no shutdown
ip address 10.90.0.2 255.255.255.252
ip nat inside

interface GigabitEthernet0/0/2
no shutdown
ip address 203.0.113.1 255.255.255.252
ip nat outside

ip nat inside source static tcp 10.70.0.2 80 203.0.113.1 80
ip nat inside source static tcp 10.70.0.2 443 203.0.113.1 443

ip route 0.0.0.0 0.0.0.0 203.0.113.2 
ip route 10.10.0.0 255.255.255.0 10.90.0.1
ip route 10.20.0.0 255.255.255.0 10.90.0.1
ip route 10.30.0.0 255.255.255.0 10.90.0.1
ip route 10.40.0.0 255.255.255.0 10.90.0.1
ip route 10.50.0.0 255.255.255.0 10.90.0.1
ip route 10.60.0.0 255.255.255.0 10.90.0.1
ip route 10.70.0.0 255.255.255.0 10.90.0.1
ip route 10.80.0.0 255.255.255.0 10.90.0.1

access-list 110 deny   ip 10.0.0.0 0.255.255.255 172.16.0.0 0.0.255.255
access-list 110 permit ip 10.0.0.0 0.255.255.255 any
ip nat inside source list 110 interface GigabitEthernet0/0/2 overload

access-list 101 permit ip 10.0.0.0 0.255.255.255 172.16.0.0 0.0.255.255

crypto isakmp policy 10
encryption aes 256
hash sha
authentication pre-share
group 2
lifetime 86400
crypto isakmp key VPNkey123 address 203.0.113.6

crypto ipsec transform-set TS esp-aes 256 esp-sha-hmac

crypto map VPN-MAP 10 ipsec-isakmp
description VPN to office 3
set peer 203.0.113.6
set transform-set TS
match address 101

interface GigabitEthernet0/0/2
crypto map VPN-MAP
end
write memory